# Compose-level env for Ella's host sidecars (docker-compose.yml). Copy to .env only
# if you need to override; the sidecars run without it. Hermes runtime secrets are
# separate — see config/.env.example (seeded into ~/.hermes/.env).
#
# Miniflux moved to oracle (oracle/vendors/miniflux.compose.yml): its admin
# credentials and Postgres now live there, not here. Ella's `feeds` adapter still
# consumes it at host.docker.internal:8930 (or miniflux:8080 on `workspace`); set
# MINIFLUX_* in ~/.hermes/.env per config/.env.example.
#
# Observability (Grafana/Loki/Prometheus + alerting → Telegram) also moved to oracle;
# the former monitoring TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN / TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID alert vars belong there.
# The telemetry sidecars here (chat-shipper, status-exporter) need no env.
